he deployment. But the user is restricted to using the exec_kubectl_cmd_safely tool. \n\nGiven the constraints, the user should try to correct the JSON syntax again, ensuring that all braces are properly nested and that there are no extra characters. Maybe the issue is a missing comma or an extra brace. Let me re-express the JSON with proper formatting and check for any syntax errors.\n</think>\n\n', additional_kwargs={'tool_calls': [{'function': {'arguments': '{"command": "kubectl patch deployment aux-service -n hotel-reservation -p \'{\\"spec\\":{\\"template\\":{\\"spec\\":{\\"containers\\":[{\\"name\\":\\"aux-service\\",\\"ports\\":[{\\"containerPort\\":8081,\\"name\\":\\"http\\",\\"protocol\\":\\"TCP\\"}]}}]}}}\'"}', 'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely'}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b6dfffa9ebfb1914', 'type': 'function'}], 'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': {'completion_tokens': 1271, 'prompt_tokens': 5748, 'total_tokens': 7019, 'completion_tokens_details': None, 'prompt_tokens_details': None}, 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'tool_calls', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfc4c-7a51-7060-b018-b579f1931206-0', tool_calls=[{'name': 'exec_kubectl_cmd_safely', 'args': {'command': 'kubectl patch deployment aux-service -n hotel-reservation -p \'{"spec":{"template":{"spec":{"containers":[{"name":"aux-service","ports":[{"containerPort":8081,"name":"http","protocol":"TCP"}]}}]}}}\''}, 'id': 'chatcmpl-tool-b6dfffa9ebfb1914', 'type': 'tool_call'}], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 5748, 'output_tokens': 1271, 'total_tokens': 7019}), ToolMessage(content="Dry-run failed. Potentially it's an invalid command. stderr: Error from server (BadRequest): invalid character '}' after array element\n", id='68b22f3c-8d66-4b7b-9372-b0b81cfea89b', tool_call_id='chatcmpl-tool-b6dfffa9ebfb1914'), HumanMessage(content='You are now in the thinking stage. Choos